{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to plants with multiple OAI and VAI inspections before the 2016-02-03 shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "D8", "D9", "E11", "E13", "E15", "E27"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the sodium acetate shortage on 2016-02-03 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E40", "E36", "E37", "E38", "E39"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) received OAI classifications after inspections ending 2010-01-19, 2011-06-17, and 2011-08-04, all before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E13", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) received an OAI classification after an inspection ending 2019-09-06, with the classification letter dated 2020-05-25.",
      "cites": ["E27", "D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both plants also have multiple VAI inspections before and after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E22", "E23", "E24", "E25", "E26", "E28"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 11.4 days on hand for the 20 mL presentation and 16.5 days for the 50 mL presentation; Corvale General has 22.1 and 19.5 days respectively.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals Private Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether Amneal's manufacturing site can be identified and qualified, as its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    }
  ]
}
